THE NORTH LAWN, THANK YOU.

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.471 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:07.874 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: LET'S BRING IN THE

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:08.675 line:78%
PRESIDENT OF FINLAND;

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:10.443 line:78%
MR. PRESIDENT, THANK YOU FOR THE

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:13.313 line:78%
TIME.

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:14.347 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.814 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU SHARE A LONG BORDER

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:16.249 line:78%
WITH RUSSIA.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:18.518 line:78%
IF YOU LOOK AT THE MAP, YOU

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:21.388 line:78%
COULD DRAW ALMOST A PERFECT

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:22.722 line:78%
TRIANGLE TO MOSCOW, KYIV, AND

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.891 line:78%
HELSINKI.

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:26.860 line:78%
HOW DO YOU SEE THE LAST 8, 9

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:31.097 line:78%
DAYS?

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:34.501 line:78%
&gt;&gt; , LIKE I GUESS ALL OF US, WE

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:37.003 line:78%
ARE VERY SURPRISED, SOMETHING

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:37.303 line:78%
ALMOST IMPOSSIBLE HAS TAKEN

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:40.273 line:78%
PLACE.

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:44.210 line:78%
NO ONE COULD HAVE IMAGINED THAT

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:49.449 line:78%
IN EUROPE, IN 2020, SOMETHING

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:53.019 line:78%
LIKE THIS WOULD HAPPEN.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:56.990 line:78%
AND SEEMS TO CONTINUE.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:58.525 line:78%
IT IS -- IT'S TRAGEDY.

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:59.959 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU HAD A MEETING TODAY

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:00.293 line:78%
WITH PRESIDENT BIDEN IN THE OVAL

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.161 line:78%
OFFICE.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.462 line:78%
HOW DID YOU TAKE THAT MEETING

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.729 line:78%
AND WHAT DID YOU TAKE AWAY FROM

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:06.299 line:78%
IT.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:09.803 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WE DISCUSSED QUITE A LOT NOT

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:12.405 line:78%
ONLY THE CURRENT SITUATION IN

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:12.739 line:78%
UKRAINE, WE TALKED ALSO ABOUT

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:14.174 line:78%
RUSSIA.

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:18.545 line:78%
ABOUT CHINA.

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:18.912 line:78%
BUT ALSO FROM THE NORDIC

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:21.948 line:78%
COUNTRIES.

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:22.849 line:78%
AND HOW DO WE TAKE THIS?

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:25.051 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: DO YOU WANT TO JOIN

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:29.322 line:78%
NATO NOW?

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:32.625 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE HAVE A STRANGE

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:32.992 line:78%
SITUATION IN BOTH IN FINLAND AND

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.794 line:78%
SWEDEN.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:38.298 line:78%
FOR THE FIRST TIME WE SEE THAT

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:39.766 line:78%
MATURITY OF PEOPLE ARE PRO,

00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:43.470 line:78%
ACCORDING TO THE POLLS.

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:46.239 line:78%
AND THIS IS SOMETHING WE ARE NOW

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:46.639 line:78%
OPEN TO DISCUSSING WITH OUR

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:52.345 line:78%
PARLIAMENT.

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:53.546 line:78%
WE TRY TO DEFINE ALL THE

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:55.081 line:78%
CIRCUMSTANCES, ALL THE RISKS,

00:01:53.646 --> 00:02:00.120 line:78%
AND ALL THE BENEFITS.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:02:02.989 line:78%
AND TO DOING THAT QUITE

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:03.823 line:78%
EFFICIENTLY AS SOON AS POSSIBLE.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:05.525 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: MR. PRESIDENT, THERE IS

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:07.127 line:78%
AN ARTICLE IN THE ATLANTIC

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.995 line:78%
COUNCIL IT, SAYS WILL FINLAND

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:11.731 line:78%
AND SWEDEN JOIN NATO NOW?

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:13.933 line:78%
A QUOTE FROM THAT, FOR FINLAND,

00:02:11.831 --> 00:02:14.834 line:78%
THE SHADOW OF HISTORY IS ALWAYS

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.536 line:78%
PRESENT.

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:19.839 line:78%
AN 833-MILE LONG BORDER WITH

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:21.274 line:78%
RUSSIA MEANS THAT FINLAND KNOWS

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:22.475 line:78%
IT CAN NEVER TAKE ITS

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:24.110 line:78%
SOVEREIGNTY FOR GRANTED.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:26.646 line:78%
FINS HAVEN'T FORGOTTEN SOVIET

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:27.881 line:78%
DEMANDS ON LAND AND HARBORS IN

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:30.083 line:78%
1939 WHILE SECRETLY PRECINCT FOR

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:31.451 line:78%
AN INVASION WHICH MOSCOW

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:31.851 line:78%
LAUNCHED IN NOVEMBER OF THAT

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:34.354 line:78%
YEAR.

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:36.489 line:78%
THERE IS A LOT OF HISTORY.

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:39.025 line:78%
THAT MAY BE WILL LEAN YOU NOW

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:41.394 line:78%
CONSIDERING WHAT'S HAPPENING

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:42.896 line:78%
TOWARDS GETTING INTO NATO.

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:49.569 line:78%
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:50.970 line:78%
BACK TO 1939, EXCEPT THAT RUSSIA

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:52.105 line:78%
ATTACKED WE PROTECTED AND

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:54.641 line:78%
DEFENDED OUR COUNTRY.

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:55.875 line:78%
THEY DIDN'T COME IN.

00:02:54.774 --> 00:03:00.446 line:78%
ONE HAS TO REMEMBER THAT.

00:02:57.377 --> 00:03:01.181 line:78%
AND SURELY, THAT REMINDS THE

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:01.648 line:78%
SITUATION IN UKRAINE AT THE

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:04.484 line:78%
MOMENT.

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:11.157 line:78%
YOU HAVE TO REMEMBER, ALSO, THAT

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:12.892 line:78%
FINLAND HAS MAYBE WE HAVE A BIT

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:13.259 line:78%
DIFFERENTLY THAN MANY EUROPEAN

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:16.529 line:78%
COUNTRIES.

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:19.132 line:78%
WE HAVE ALL THE TIME, HAVE BEEN

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:21.467 line:78%
VERY KEEN ON DEVELOPING OUR OWN

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:24.571 line:78%
DEFENSE FORCES, WHICH ARE QUITE

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:26.673 line:78%
STRONG ONES.

00:03:24.671 --> 00:03:28.875 line:78%
SO, THAT'S ONE ELEMENT

00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:32.579 line:78%
PROTECTING SUCCESS.

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:33.913 line:78%
AND EUROPEAN UNION, IF NOW MAYBE

00:03:32.679 --> 00:03:37.650 line:78%
MORE UNITED THAN EVER.

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:39.219 line:78%
WE SEE ALSO GERMANY TAKING

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.652 line:78%
STRONG POSITION ON DEFENSE

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:43.389 line:78%
SECTOR.

00:03:39.953 --> 00:03:45.625 line:78%
THAT MEANS THAT ALSO EUROPE WILL

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:49.929 line:78%
COVER MORE SECURITY.

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:50.763 line:78%
AND THE THIRD ELEMENT IS

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:52.432 line:78%
MEMBERSHIP OF NATO.

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:56.836 line:78%
LIKE I SAID THAT IS UNDER

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:58.571 line:78%
DISCUSSION IN FINLAND.

00:03:57.303 --> 00:04:00.073 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU ALREADY SPEND MORE

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:00.840 line:78%
THAN 2% OF YOUR G.D.P. ON

00:04:00.173 --> 00:04:02.175 line:78%
DEFENSE FORCES.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.509 line:78%
YOU MENTIONED GERMANY.

00:04:02.275 --> 00:04:05.144 line:78%
RUSSIAN PRESIDENT VLADIMIR PUTIN

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.446 line:78%
TALKED TO THE CHANCELLOR OF

00:04:05.245 --> 00:04:08.214 line:78%
GERMANY TODAY.

00:04:06.546 --> 00:04:09.916 line:78%
ACCORDING TO THE READ OUT, HE

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:12.118 line:78%
DENIED THAT RUSSIAN FORCES ARE

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:14.520 line:78%
BOMBING UKRAINIAN CITIES.

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:14.821 line:78%
I WANT TO ASK YOU ABOUT VLADIMIR

00:04:14.621 --> 00:04:16.589 line:78%
PUTIN.

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:16.889 line:78%
YOU HAVE MET HIM A NUMBER OF

00:04:16.689 --> 00:04:18.124 line:78%
TIMES.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:19.759 line:78%
YOU HAVE HAD A LOT OF MEETINGS.

00:04:18.358 --> 00:04:21.527 line:78%
MANY MORE, PERHAPS, THAN OTHER

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:25.465 line:78%
LEADERS IN THE REGION.

00:04:21.628 --> 00:04:26.132 line:78%
HAVE YOU NOTICED A CHANGE IN

00:04:25.565 --> 00:04:29.802 line:78%
PUTIN?

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:33.406 line:78%
&gt;&gt; IF YOU FOLLOW HIS SPEECHES

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:36.142 line:78%
AND OPINIONS, DURING DECADES, HE

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:40.046 line:78%
HAS ALWAYS SHOWED SOME KIND OF

00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:42.348 line:78%
BITTERNESS AND EVEN HATRED.

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:43.983 line:78%
BECAUSE HE HAS SAID MOTHER

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:46.953 line:78%
RUSSIA HAS BEEN MISTREATED.

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:49.889 line:78%
AND THIS KIND OF AN ATTITUDE HAS

00:04:47.053 --> 00:04:52.992 line:78%
INCREASED YEAR AFTER YEAR.

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:55.161 line:78%
NOW THAT WE ALL HAVE SEEN HOW,

00:04:53.293 --> 00:05:00.400 line:78%
ANY WAY LONELY HE SEEMS TO BE

00:04:55.261 --> 00:05:02.502 line:78%
AND MAKES BIG DISTANCE TO OTHER

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:07.440 line:78%
PEOPLE IT'S NOT POSSIBLE FOR A

00:05:02.602 --> 00:05:08.975 line:78%
PERSON LIVE ONLY WITH HIS BITTER

00:05:07.674 --> 00:05:13.780 line:78%
AND HATE.

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:16.616 line:78%
THAT MIGHT INCREASE IN HIS

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:20.253 line:78%
THINKING.

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:21.487 line:78%
SO, WILL MAYBE -- HUH?

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:25.024 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: DO YOU THINK THAT HE

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:31.631 line:78%
WILL EXPAND BEYOND UKRAINE?

00:05:26.959 --> 00:05:32.532 line:78%
&gt;&gt; ALREADY SO FAR SOMETHING WE

00:05:31.731 --> 00:05:34.600 line:78%
CONSIDERED AS IMPOSSIBLE.

00:05:32.632 --> 00:05:36.235 line:78%
AND IT'S VERY DIFFICULT TO

00:05:34.701 --> 00:05:36.569 line:78%
PREDICT WHAT HE IS GOING TO DO

00:05:36.336 --> 00:05:39.505 line:78%
NEXT.

00:05:36.669 --> 00:05:41.374 line:78%
BUT NOW IT SEEMS THAT HE IS

00:05:39.605 --> 00:05:44.677 line:78%
GOING FORWARD AND DESTROYING

00:05:41.474 --> 00:05:45.678 line:78%
UKRAINE.

00:05:44.844 --> 00:05:46.112 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: LAST THING,

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:48.514 line:78%
MR. PRESIDENT.

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:50.483 line:78%
THE NATO SECRETARY GENERAL HAS

00:05:48.614 --> 00:05:52.118 line:78%
SAID THAT NATO WARPLANES WILL

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:55.054 line:78%
NOT DO A NO-FLY ZONE.

00:05:52.785 --> 00:05:55.955 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WE UNDERSTAND THE

00:05:55.154 --> 00:05:58.925 line:78%
DESPERATION.

00:05:56.155 --> 00:06:00.526 line:78%
BUT ALSO BELIEVE THAT IF WE DID

00:05:59.025 --> 00:06:03.162 line:78%
THAT, WE'LL END UP WITH

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.364 line:78%
SOMETHING THAT COULD END IN A

00:06:03.262 --> 00:06:05.665 line:78%
FULL-FLEDGED WAR IN EUROPE

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:08.501 line:78%
INVOLVING MANY MORE COUNTRIES.

00:06:05.965 --> 00:06:12.238 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I ASSUME YOU AGREE WITH THAT

00:06:08.634 --> 00:06:12.538 line:78%
BUT WHERE DO YOU THINK THIS IS

00:06:12.338 --> 00:06:16.843 line:78%
GOING.

00:06:14.507 --> 00:06:20.880 line:78%
&gt;&gt; SURELY IT'S A NATO DECISION.

00:06:16.943 --> 00:06:25.151 line:78%
BUT I UNDERSTAND THAT NOW

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:26.786 line:78%
EVERYBODY WANTS TO AVOID MORE

00:06:25.251 --> 00:06:27.987 line:78%
ESCALATION, WHICH IS ALL THE

00:06:26.886 --> 00:06:30.923 line:78%
TIME VERY NEARBY.

00:06:28.087 --> 00:06:33.659 line:78%
THERE MIGHT BE EVEN ACCIDENTAL

00:06:31.057 --> 00:06:37.530 line:78%
DEEDS, WHICH SUDDENLY BREAK OUT

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:41.033 line:78%
AND IF WE HAVE ESCALATION, WE

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:44.737 line:78%
HAVE HUGE WAR IN FRONT OF US.

00:06:41.134 --> 00:06:48.174 line:78%
SO, TRYING TO SAFEGUARD THAT, I

00:06:44.837 --> 00:06:52.111 line:78%
THINK, IS THE REASON WHY NATO IS

00:06:48.274 --> 00:06:53.613 line:78%
NOT PRESENT.

00:06:52.278 --> 00:06:54.580 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: PRESIDENT OF FINLAND,

00:06:53.713 --> 00:06:56.682 line:78%
MR. PRESIDENT, WE REALLY

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.682 line:78%
APPRECIATE YOUR TIME ON "SPECIAL

